Package: r401k
Title: Separate 401(k) Deposits from Market Returns
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("chjacamp", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "13806192+chjacamp@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A Shiny dashboard that rebuilds a 401(k) account from dated
    transactions and the fund's daily prices, then reports the fund's return,
    your money-weighted return, and the raw change in balance side by side,
    so deposits are never mistaken for investment gains. Also projects a
    retirement balance under different contribution rates.
